(text "Socket pin numbering is the module top view: antenna at the top, USB connectors at the bottom." (at 18 255 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5382b273-16fa-5609-bf82-b1a0b3061b42))
(text "Only genuine DevKitC-1 v1.1 N8R8 geometry is qualified by this drawing. No generic ESP32 boards." (at 18 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e5ef68ab-5b4b-572c-a5cf-89cbcf9ff70e))
(text "GPIO0/3/45/46 (straps), GPIO19/20 (USB), GPIO35/36/37 (PSRAM), GPIO38/48 (RGB variants) are not used." (at 18 265 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ae2a8213-4205-5062-af6f-e78970280936))
(text "Remove the controller module from BOTH sockets before USB flashing. Never connect USB and carrier power together." (at 18 270 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 891c6ea9-b31f-53e4-817d-bd7d59e136ef))
